<title>JAPAN: Korea Container Terminal launches 2.95% samurai.</title>
<headline>Korea Container Terminal launches 2.95% samurai.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following samurai issue was announced by lead manager Kokusai Securities on Wednesday:</p>
<p> BORROWER	  South Korea's state-owned Korea Container</p>
<p>			Terminal Authority</p>
<p> AMT		 4.3 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON	    2.95 pct</p>
<p> ISS PRICE	 par</p>
<p> MATURITY	  31 July 2007</p>
<p> PAY DATE	  31 July 1997</p>
<p> SUB PERIOD	July 29 to July 30</p>
<p> PAY FREQ	  Semi-annual</p>
<p> LAST RATING     JBRI AA+</p>
<p> LEAD MANAGER    Kokusai Securities</p>
<p> LEAD TRUSTEE    Sakura Bank</p>
</text>
